---
// The post-submit page. Without action="/thanks" on the form, Netlify serves
// its own grey branded receipt and that becomes the last thing a prospect sees.
// It also gives analytics a real conversion URL to count.
//
// noindex is one of the two allowed in the system: a thank-you page that ranks
// sends cold traffic to a page reading as though they already enquired, and it
// inflates the conversion count with people who never submitted anything.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { url } from '../lib/url';
---
<Base
  title="Got it"
  description={`Your details are with ${site.owner}. He reads every one himself and comes back the same day.`}
  path="/thanks"
  noindex
>
  <section class="section ty">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow label">
        <span>Enquiry received</span>
        <span class="head-dim">&middot; Same day reply</span>
      </p>
      <h1>Got it. That is with me now.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        I read every one myself and usually come back the same day. If it is urgent, do not
        wait on the email, just ring.
      </p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={`tel:${site.phoneHref}`}>Call {site.owner} on {site.phoneDisplay}</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={url('/work')}>Look at the work while you wait</a>
      </div>

      <ol class="next">
        <li>
          <span class="mono">01</span>
          <p><strong>I read it.</strong> Usually the same day, and I work out whether a site is actually the right thing for you.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="mono">02</span>
          <p><strong>You get a demo.</strong> If it is a fit, a working site with your name on it inside 48 hours, on a real address you can open on your phone.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="mono">03</span>
          <p><strong>Nothing else.</strong> No mailing list, no automated follow-up sequence, and your details go nowhere but my inbox.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .ty h1 { margin: 24px 0 22px; max-width: 16ch; }
  .lead { font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 20px); color: var(--on-light-soft); max-width: 50ch; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .next { margin-top: 44px; padding-top: 28px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); display: grid; gap: 20px; max-width: 62ch; }
  .next li { display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .next span { flex: none; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .16em; color: var(--on-light-soft); padding-top: 4px; }
  .next p { font-size: 15.5px; color: var(--on-light-soft); }
  .next strong { color: var(--ink); }
</style>
